Z||000000||grinthock||11-14-2001||11:23 PM||||New Exhaust Installed Today<P>Done by NoyzBoyz Performance Exhaust here in Toronto, HIGHLY recommended.<P>2.5" Exhaust all the way from the bottom of the X-Over to the back, new high flow cat, Flowmaster muffler, and the tips as you see them.<P>I am VERY happy, SOUNDS GREAT!  They do amazing work... <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Picture_7.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Picture_10.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Picture_13.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroworld.com</A>  The place to go for Fiero INFO! <BR>Home of my 87 GT and 85 GT<BR>Justin C.<BR>Engineer, Designer and<BR>Technical Trainer for Nortel Networks Business Products.||||reg||1
Z||000001||72vinman||11-14-2001||11:42 PM||||Hey Grint, How much did that run you $$$.<BR>That is one of the next things on my winter list. Would you happen to have an MP3 of what it sounds like.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigvin2_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
