Z||000004||Jncomutt||11-15-2001||01:52 AM||||Man!!!  The most important part!!  The thing that adds the HP!!  Its crooked..  Look, the sticker looks to be slightly tilted.  I'd fix that before a honda driver notices...<BR>LOL... just kiddin with ya, the exhaust looks GREAT!||||reg||1
Z||000005||grinthock||11-15-2001||01:52 AM||||Thanks guys!  The place I got it from charged me about $1000 CDN Taxes included, price varies depending on the tips you choose.  It's full custom, they do all the work, mandral bend all the pipes right there on the spot.<P>The tips ran me $95 each installed.  <P>I will do a video of it tommorow with FieroHeather and show ya'll what it looks like!<P><P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroworld.com</A>  The place to go for Fiero INFO! <BR>Home of my 87 GT and 85 GT<BR>Justin C.<BR>Engineer, Designer and<BR>Technical Trainer for Nortel Networks Business Products.||||reg||1
Z||000006||grinthock||11-15-2001||02:05 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Jncomutt:<BR><B>Man!!!  The most important part!!  The thing that adds the HP!!  Its crooked..  Look, the sticker looks to be slightly tilted.  I'd fix that before a honda driver notices...<BR>LOL... just kiddin with ya, the exhaust looks GREAT!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Actually, it's not crooked, it just looks that way in the pic, the rear bumper is on an angle both up/down and left/right, it looks proper from behind, just not from that angle.  If you look at pic 1, it appears straight from behind, which is the idea.<P>I do'nt do the sticker thing, that one is small enough for me.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000007||grinthock||11-15-2001||10:52 AM||||As promised here is a quick MP3 I did this morning.<P>FieroHeather has promised to help me do a real video.<P>I have a new FieroVideo due out sometime before the new year, includes drag footage by BanditBalz and crew, my own footage, and some new content.  Watch for it.  I plan on offering it via DVD mail in too.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/grinthock" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/grinthock</A> <p>[This message has been edited by grinthock (edited 11-15-2001).]||||reg||1
