Z||000016||x-thumpr-x||11-15-2001||10:18 PM||||Mitas does charge alot! I picked up the exhuast(muffler) myself for cost price, phoned Mitas up to see how much to install. They wanted $70 for an install and $160 to bend me a tail pipe! That's not including the Tip.  Called a place in Oshawa (Custom Exhuast) and the owner said he would install and bend a pipe for $100. Bought the tip from him for $90.<P>P.S. all prices in Canadian..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Hey Grinthock, should have told me you coming in to town, I live 1km away from Mitas.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by x-thumpr-x (edited 11-15-2001).]||||reg||1
