Z||000018||grinthock||11-15-2001||10:56 PM||||To answer some questions, yes it probably cost me a LITTLE more.. Let's look at what was also done.<P>Custom design the way I WANTED it, meaning I got to setup the angle, depth, how far it stuck out and at what angles and they did it the way I asked.<P>They did all new hangers for me.<P>YES they charge a little more but they are AMAZING, they do AMAZING work, and I have never EVER had a problem with them.<P>I guess for me it's worth it to pay a little more.<P><BR>The Video will be done, as soon as I get the time, I also need to retrieve the video from Bandit.||||reg||1
